{"4607460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gauchesca", "steam_appid": 4607460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607460/extras/fa15fa30d6e0bb2341d43047cc47ebbb.avif?t=1776455422\" width=1536 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gauchesca</strong> is a narrative-driven visual novel that blends Argentine mythology with the traditional card game Truco, inspired by classic gauchesque literature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to play Truco while interacting with a variety of characters and discovering their stories within a supernatural tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Martina Chapanay, a legendary gaucha forced to participate in a Truco tournament organized by San La Muerte. In this challenge, each match is a duel of strategy and deception: the winner is granted a wish, while the loser loses their soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the tournament, you will face opponents inspired by Argentine mythology and literature, each with their own personality and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the mechanics of Truco, bluff your rivals, and make strategic decisions that can change the outcome of each match. Every encounter presents new challenges that require you to adapt your tactics to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a unique hand-painted art style, inspired by traditional Argentine artwork, bringing its world and characters to life with a distinctive visual identity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Truco with strategic and narrative elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unique opponents inspired by Argentine folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven progression through a supernatural tournament</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted visual style inspired by gauchesque culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions that influence your path and outcomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607460/extras/876bd27a000d9c169f2b5603aed6b148.poster.avif?t=1776455422\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607460/extras/876bd27a000d9c169f2b5603aed6b148.webm?t=1776455422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607460/extras/876bd27a000d9c169f2b5603aed6b148.mp4?t=1776455422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607460/extras/fa15fa30d6e0bb2341d43047cc47ebbb.avif?t=1776455422\" width=1536 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gauchesca</strong> is a narrative-driven visual novel that blends Argentine mythology with the traditional card game Truco, inspired by classic gauchesque literature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to play Truco while interacting with a variety of characters and discovering their stories within a supernatural tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Martina Chapanay, a legendary gaucha forced to participate in a Truco tournament organized by San La Muerte. In this challenge, each match is a duel of strategy and deception: the winner is granted a wish, while the loser loses their soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the tournament, you will face opponents inspired by Argentine mythology and literature, each with their own personality and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the mechanics of Truco, bluff your rivals, and make strategic decisions that can change the outcome of each match. Every encounter presents new challenges that require you to adapt your tactics to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a unique hand-painted art style, inspired by traditional Argentine artwork, bringing its world and characters to life with a distinctive visual identity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Truco with strategic and narrative elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unique opponents inspired by Argentine folklore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven progression through a supernatural tournament</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted visual style inspired by gauchesque culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions that influence your path and outcomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607460/extras/876bd27a000d9c169f2b5603aed6b148.poster.avif?t=1776455422\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607460/extras/876bd27a000d9c169f2b5603aed6b148.webm?t=1776455422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607460/extras/876bd27a000d9c169f2b5603aed6b148.mp4?t=1776455422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Gauchesca is a story-driven Truco game inspired by Argentine mythology. Play as Martina Chapanay, bluff and strategize against supernatural opponents in a deadly tournament where each match risks your soul.", "supported_languages": "Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.